    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Junk In offers players an engaging simulation experience as a homeless person, capturing the everyday challenges and survival situations faced on the streets. This casual simulator features level-based gameplay, with each level presenting a unique scenario for players to navigate and overcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World Exploration</strong>: Navigate a city filled with interactive environments, from busy streets to hidden corners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Scavenging</strong>: Collect scrap, discarded items, and rare finds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level-Based Progression</strong>: Unlock new levels, each offering fresh challenges and unique survival skills to master.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive another day?</p>",
